      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey! I figured this out!\n\nOpen the file `UdonGraph.cs` at \n\n`com.vrchat.worlds\\Editor\\Udon\\ProgramSources\\UdonGraphProgram\\UI\\GraphView\\UdonGraph.cs`\n\nGo to line 1044 and change it to \n\n`else if (!Settings.UseNeonStyle && styleSheets.Contains(neonStyle))`\n\nThen save the file, wait for Unity to recompile it, and the toggle should work as expected!\n\nQuick explanation:\n\nThe changed line looks almost identical, but that 2nd condition `styleSheets.Contains(neonStyle)` is negated with the `!` in the original code, and I think that's just a simple mistake!\n\nThankfully this is a super easy fix! Hopefully they can fix it in the SDK soon.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-14T23:18:37.053Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The Graph editor has a check mark in the welcome page for \"Use Neon Style\" which you can enable. If you disable it however, this change does not apply until the graph window is manually closed and reopened.",
